{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"chengguo-e-p162a","title":"孙资与田豫等释怨结婚","accounts":[{"id":"chengguo-a-3c116f8932edcd347f41","label":"裴注·《资别传》","text":"孙资与田豫等释怨结婚","evidence":["chengguo-q-a29f3a0bdd379948b118"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0075","role":"与豫释怨为宏娶女","evidence":["chengguo-q-a29f3a0bdd379948b118"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0025","role":"求释怨","evidence":["chengguo-q-a29f3a0bdd379948b118"]},{"person":"chengguo-p0011","role":"妒害资","evidence":["chengguo-q-a29f3a0bdd379948b118"]},{"person":"chengguo-p0020","role":"构谤","evidence":["chengguo-q-a29f3a0bdd379948b118"]},{"person":"chengguo-p0007","role":"娶田豫女","evidence":["chengguo-q-a29f3a0bdd379948b118"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文","precision":"undated","basis":"拆分行动分别核对；无本条直接释年，不承袭复合候选公元年。","evidence":["chengguo-q-a29f3a0bdd379948b118"]},"ordering_evidence":"chengguo-q-a29f3a0bdd379948b118","source_order":[14,511,210],"order":3203}],"persons":[{"id":"chengguo-p0011","name":"宗艳","evidence":["chengguo-q-a29f3a0bdd379948b118"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-a29f3a0bdd379948b118","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-e0d538a4c9d8de18da89","layer":"pei","quote":"资在邦邑，名出同类之右。乡人司空掾田豫、梁相宗艳，皆妒害之；而杨丰党附豫等，专为资构造谤端，怨隙甚重。资既不以为言，而终无恨意。豫等惭服，求释宿憾，结为婚姻。资谓之曰：‘吾无憾心，不知所释。此为卿自薄之，卿自厚之耳！’乃为长子宏娶其女。","attribution":"裴注·《资别传》","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":510,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-dd527f858b45627ff07f","start":210,"end":328,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
